sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant W as Web
    participant A as API
    participant K as Worker
    participant D as DB
    U->>W: Submit order
    W->>A: POST /orders
    A->>D: insert order
    D-->>A: id
    A->>K: enqueue charge
    A-->>W: 202 Accepted
    W-->>U: Order received
    K->>K: charge job
    K->>D: update status
    K-->>A: done
    loop every 5s
        W->>A: GET /orders/id
        A-->>W: status
    end
